      "sc:citation": {
        "@id": "https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-031-73116-7_27"
      },
      "sc:description": "Trackastra is a transformer-based cell-tracking tool for live-cell microscopy. It links already segmented cell instances across time by predicting associations between detections. It supports greedy tracking with or without cell divisions, optional ILP-based linking, pretrained tracking models, and export of tracked masks and lineage information in Cell Tracking Challenge format.",
